     },
     {
      "id": "hs_kb03",
      "subject": "Webhook deliveries failing intermittently",
      "status": "active",
      "mailbox_id": "mb_general",
      "customer_email": "ops@techfirm.com",
      "tags": [
       "technical"
      ],
      "threads": [
       {
        "id": "4902096672",
        "thread_type": "customer",
        "body": "Our webhooks are failing about 30% of the time. How do we debug this?",
        "author_email": "ops@techfirm.com",
        "created_at": "2026-08-14T00:00:00"
       },
       {
        "id": "7002497832",
        "thread_type": "reply",
        "body": "Here's a comprehensive troubleshooting guide for webhook failures:\n\n1. Check the webhook delivery log at Settings > Webhooks > Delivery Log\n2. Look for HTTP status codes - 4xx means your endpoint rejected it, 5xx means your server had an error\n3. Common causes: Timeout (must respond within 30s), SSL issues, Payload size over 256KB\n4. To test: Use our webhook tester at Settings > Webhooks > Test Delivery\n5. Enable retry mode: Settings > Webhooks > Advanced > Enable Auto-Retry",
        "author_email": "agent@support.com",
        "created_at": "2026-08-14T00:00:00"
       }
      ],
      "created_at": "2026-08-14T00:00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-14T00:00:00"
     },
     {
